      "created_at": "2015-08-13T18:54:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So let's say a card is played that does huge damage to everything (like Powered Shockwave when Unity has a lot of bots out) against Apostate with Relic Spirit on the table and only Runes of Malediction in the trash.</p><p>The attack hits the Relic Spirit, destroys it, and Runes of Malediction is brought out of the trash. The attack is still going on, so it then clobbers Runes of Malediction, destroying it. When it dies, it pulls Demons out of the trash, which would revive the Relic Spirit.</p><p>Does the attack continue by hitting the Relic Spirit, starting the whole thing over again?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:13.860Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 2,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 10.0,
