      "created_at": "2015-08-13T18:58:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes and no. It would hit the Relic Spirit again, but the loop wouldn't continue.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Relic Spirit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Relic Spirit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The first time a Relic Spirit is destroyed each turn…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
