      "created_at": "2015-08-24T21:12:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What if Smoke Bombs are out, Visionary's Decoy Projection is the lowest HP hero target, and Visionary is the highest HP Hero target? Both cards say \"Whenever X would take damage,\" so neither are once per turn. So wouldn't that mean if a villain target hits either, it will just keep being redirected between the two of them?</p>",
