    {
      "id": 146212,
      "name": "Donner",
      "username": "Donner",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-24T21:31:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Viz takes the damage unfortunately. &nbsp; That loop can happen in the app currently and you end up with Viz taking the damage.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is because each redirection can really only occur once. &nbsp;So, first the damage is redirected to the decoy projection, then it is redirected to Visionary (but reduced by 1). &nbsp;If it was damage to the Decoy Projection instead, it would go to Visionary (from Smoke Bombs) and then to the Decoy Projection, but reduced by 1.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
